The update patch 1.1 is now live. Here some changes of this release:

- First in-game achievements are added to the game;
- The 'First aid kit' item has been replaced by 'Charm of fury' item;
- Some icon has been enhanced;
- Many entries have been translated;
- The illustrations on the tutorial will be skipped on hard mode;
- Bug (rare) resolved when going into pause...

... and other minor changes

This update brings animated portraits into gallery for rescued girls. Here the changelog:


- After saving 8/16 girls, a code is revealed to allow you to re-unlock them (if you lost the savegame);

- Added other girls into gallery;

- Added some tips at game start;

- Some text has been translated;

- Girls rescued into dungeons will unlocks a specific animation into gallery;

- Some texts have been translated;

- Some girls and some cards have been changed/improved;

- Minor changes to game.
